","description_fr":"Passionnée de plongée sous-marine, Naomi a trouvé son petit coin de paradis dans les Antilles. En couple avec Jackson, alors en déplacement, c'est seule que la jeune femme quitte Antigua pour rejoindre la Grenade à bord de leur voilier Serenity, une traversée de 48 heures qu'elle imagine paisible. Elle croise cependant la route de naufragés qu'elle va devoir secourir dans des eaux infestées de requins alors qu'une terrible tempête menace.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ms1omYCnhnO3eDOI88tfiy6SaoX.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fgz3OhZ9zQVu5UWL6iE69fhSLXI.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":5.2,"vote_count":227,"age_rating":"15","year":"2023","release_date":"2023-10-18","runtime_minutes":84,"status":"Released","country":"المملكة المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["رعب","إثارة","حركة","غموض","أكشن"],"genre_keys":["horror","thriller","action","mystery"],"similar":["mv36586","mv536437","mv555974","mv59965","mv637649","mv1949","mv324552","mv30497"],"director":"Marcus Adams","cast":[{"name":"Mădălina Ghenea","character":"Naomi","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8ZJaeXVPRJY7OAwGm1rJJmvHYSz.jpg"},{"name":"Ed Westwick","character":"Jackson","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sI2M7uu76HUkJk562siAK8vt50.jpg"},{"name":"Macarena Gómez","character":"Maria","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2IDVZhGw13p6YdnZ8s2E8nGbMWQ.jpg"},{"name":"Stany Coppet","character":"Jose","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nxw3bLWHftIOkWC6YadarCDoxcH.jpg"},{"name":"Ibrahima Gueye","character":"Barny","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hjKG7JvxZuk9a6zmzrZcJ80cbbx.jpg"},{"name":"David Leguesse","character":"Diddle Bay","profile_image":null},{"name":"Mariana Garradas","character":"Young Naomi","profile_image":null},{"name":"Marco Canadea","character":"Naomi's Father","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nOxlmzVdkV4OLaxLjhS86a1E6l0.jpg"},{"name":"John-Paul Pace","character