 في سنة التخرج من المدرسة الثانوية نفسها مفتونة بتشويق تجلبه لعبة شهيرة عبر الإنترنت، لكن تأخذ الأحداث مجرى شريراً يؤدي إلى تصرفات خطيرة.","description_en":"","description_fr":"","poster":null,"backdrop":"https://shahid.mbc.net/mediaObject/2021/Bedour/bedour2/bedour/final/Thump_nerve/original/Thump_nerve.jpg","has_poster":false,"rating":null,"vote_count":null,"age_rating":null,"year":null,"release_date":null,"runtime_minutes":null,"status":null,"country":null,"language":null,"genres":["أكشن","إثارة","مغامرة","جريمة"],"genre_keys":["action","thriller","adventure","crime"],"similar":["mv324552","mv2207","mv637649","mv268","mv449443","mv912649","mv12085","mv254128"],"director":null,"cast":[],"trailer_url":null,"seasons_count":null,"episodes_count":null,"all_airings":[{"channel_id":"MoviesThriller.sa@SD","start":"2026-11-16T14:31:50Z","stop":"2026-11-16T16:16:50Z","start_ts":1794839510,"stop_ts":1794845810,"season":null,"episode":null},{"channel_id":"MoviesThriller.sa@SD","start":"2026-11-16T21:46:50Z","stop":"2026-11-16T23:31:50Z","start_ts":1794865610,"stop_ts":1794871910,"season":null,"episode":null},{"channel_id":"MoviesThriller.sa@SD","start":"2026-11-17T05:01:50Z","stop":"2026-11-17T06:46:50Z","start_ts":1794891710,"stop_ts":1794898010,"season":null,"episode":null}]},"mv994441":{"tmdb_id":994441,"content_type":"movie","title":"Summit Fever","title_en":null,"title_fr":null,"original_title":null,"tagline":null,"description":"يتحول حلم جريء لتسلق أخطر جبال العالم إلى صراع مرعب من أجل الحياة عندما تحاصر عاصفة قاتلة مجموعة من المتسلقين بالقرب من القمة.","description_en":"A daring dream to scale the world's most challenging trio of mountains soon turns into a terrifying nightmare for a group of friends when a deadly storm traps the climbers near the summit and cuts off all hope of rescue. With the odds stacked against them, the friends are forced to trust each other to save themselves by any means necessary.","description_fr":"Ryan Phillippe et Freddie Thorp sont les vedettes de cette course à l'adrénaline où une ambitieuse expédition en montagne devient une lutte à couper le souffle pour la survie. Un rêve audacieux d'escalader le trio de montagnes le plus difficile au monde se transforme en un cauchemar terrifiant pour un groupe d'amis lorsqu'une tempête mortelle piège les alpinistes près du sommet et leur coupe tout espoir de secours. Les chances de réussite étant très faibles, les amis sont obligés de se faire confiance pour se sauver par tous les moyens.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rX9k5v7JYmnaBO5E89PZ4yMfuvo.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/inkZbsZIWn7vCnnKuDT70F1edwK.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":5.5,"vote_count":86,"age_rating":"R","year":"2022","release_date":"2022-10-13","runtime_minutes":115,"status":"Released","country":"المملكة المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["إثارة","مغامرة","دراما"],"genre_keys":["thriller","adventure","drama"],"similar":["mv2207","mv254128","mv78","mv637649","mv1949","mv376290","mv324552","mv338766"],"director":"Julian Gilbey","cast":[{"name":"Freddie Thorp","character":"Michael","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dnhpGjYztvSb2xHmP15wy0JLTSU.jpg"},{"name":"Michel Biel","character":"Jean Pierre","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ergeo2Drf1L5MkZOve9j2BowKPP.jpg"},{"name":"Mathilde Warnier","character":"Isabelle","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xDqKNPhXzTPY5Wh9uAGx8rlHznJ.jpg"},{"name":"Théo Christine","character":"Rudi","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rNcIPvVRdjH2GlftrXkhnLimE74.jpg"},{"name":"Ryan Phillippe","character":"Leo","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/fgneZFXn0fGG1o7tMzJvHqfHHF7.jpg"},{"name":"هانا نيو","character":"Natascha","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4U4xCtzINm0zjuqSrwmEbmUxJso.jpg"},{"name":"Jocelyn Wedow","character":"Béa","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kiMYSzY9tUQef7r1jzoR6JIPiJZ.jpg"},{"name":"Gianmarco Saurino","character":"T