et de chaos qu'est Constantinople, et la ville, sous occupation britannique, reste pour lui un territoire ennemi où ses fils ont disparu. À son arrivée au port, il est accosté par le jeune Orhan qui le conduit jusqu'à l'hôtel Troya et le présente à sa mère, la belle Ayshe…","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kIlVtC22BDNiiAiCvSZoOS7FhY9.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ixJQ8u7lnCO1j7ldHAOzv3UF5Hz.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":6.8,"vote_count":1376,"age_rating":"R","year":"2014","release_date":"2014-12-25","runtime_minutes":112,"status":"Released","country":"أستراليا","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["حرب","دراما","تاريخي"],"genre_keys":["war","drama","history"],"similar":["mv429351","mv618","mv616","mv250538","mv1016084","mv1020006","mv446791","mv759643"],"director":"راسل كرو","cast":[{"name":"راسل كرو","character":"Joshua Connor","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3IBZF0qCZMZ7zJYlgrH0sQzNZV.jpg"},{"name":"أولغا كوريلنكو","character":"Ayshe","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ei6eYUhQFw2AaV6U5fyPptBaPF0.jpg"},{"name":"Yılmaz Erdoğan","character":"Major Hasan","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nl7WulHPoP6bw4phMwp0VuuJgyL.jpg"},{"name":"جم يلماز","character":"Sgt. Jemal","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/n8J3f4Ua0FWM29icutaKcg6PxFJ.jpg"},{"name":"جاي كورتني","character":"Lt. Colonel Hughes","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6vEaNwbOKov6yzQx15CdtrqfK3L.jpg"},{"name":"ريان كور","character":"Arthur \"Art\" Connor","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lQwMEXNbABIN8LTODkYHU33q19C.jpg"},{"name":"James Fraser","character":"Edward Connor","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lNzqoDoZPGhHCwp43V70GLMac8Y.jpg"},{"name":"Ben O'Toole","character":"Henry Connor","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/AwrcmZgIgBZCMU7PcVczarlo2VE.jpg"},{"name":"Steve Bastoni","character":"Omer","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gPCisCPAouIEHiO9P03O4SGIR3C.